Z||000000||GT Bastard||08-22-2000||12:15 AM||||How much compression would be gained my milling the heads .30?  What formula is used to figure this?  I'm guessing that it's not going to be worth while, but I'm curious.||||reg||5
Z||000001||terryk||08-22-2000||01:39 AM||||I think you mean .030".<P>All things being equal, around .5 increase. It depends on the several factors.<P>A rule of thumb is .2/.010" for the 660 engine. <P>You should always measure the actual compression ratio and not guess. <P> ||||reg||1
